# Mizan — environment variable template.
#
# Copy this file to `.env` (gitignored) and fill in real values there. This file itself must
# never carry a real credential — placeholders only (Step 11 SECRETS DISCIPLINE).
#
# TIINGO_API_TOKEN: the only credential Mizan uses. SEC EDGAR requires no API key, only a
# descriptive User-Agent header naming the app and a real contact email (see
# mizan/data/ingest_edgar.py). `mizan/cli/ingest.py`'s `--tiingo-token` flag reads this variable
# when the flag is omitted (PHASE_2_SPEC.md §4.4) — no Tiingo key is required for the Phase 2 test
# suite to pass; every Tiingo test runs against a mocked httpx transport.
TIINGO_API_TOKEN=
